        "Qwen3 ASR 模型需单独下载到手机；当前模型存储代码检查固定版本、文件大小与 SHA-256。",
        "下载从 Hugging Face 或 ModelScope 发起网络请求，需要带宽与空间，服务方可处理相应请求。",
        "下载模型不等于上传录音；模型可本地运行也不代表安装和所有功能都无需网络。不要跳过校验。"
      ],
      [
        "transcription",
        "2. 手机端侧转写",
        "兼容模型在手机处理语音。短语音结束后可能自动尝试守卫下的草稿填入；被拒绝或结果不明确时可保留文字。",
        "一旦文字交给网页工作台，就进入对应服务的数据边界；不能把整条交接链统称为离线。",
        "端侧识别不是全 App 不联网的证明，也没有在这里承诺准确率、任意录音时长或所有设备性能。"
      ],
      [
        "notes",
        "3. 本地录音笔记",
        "录音笔记在 App 本地保存音频与转写；当前代码为笔记目录尝试设置系统备份排除标记。",
        "用户之后的复制、分享或工作台交接会产生新的数据去向，不能用原笔记的本地保存替它们担保。",
        "源码设置备份排除不等于已经核验某台设备的备份或清除结果；不承诺所有副本都只在此手机、或已永久删除。"
      ],
      [
        "workbench",
        "4. 网页工作台与草稿交接",
        "WebKit 打开用户自己的 HTTPS 来源；当前网页数据存储是持久化的，可保留该来源的网页数据。语音文字可交给兼容草稿框。",
        "网页加载、登录、草稿处理及用户发送/上传由对应服务参与；其脚本可能保存或同步已收到的草稿。",
        "一呼不替你按发送，不等于网页在发送前不处理数据。HTTPS 和网页能打开，也不等于服务已获得所有原生增强或相同隐私规则。"
      ],
      [
        "sharing",
        "5. 系统分享收件箱",
        "文字、链接和文件先存到 App Group 收件箱，主 App 与分享扩展共享这份暂存；暂存本身不自动发送。",
        "用户选择交接后，文字可进入网页草稿，文件通过页面的附件/上传入口交给服务；上传时机和后续处理取决于工作台。",
        "暂存、交接、附件上传与消息发送不是同一个步骤。消息未发送不能证明附件未上传；不把 App Group 误称为云服务或绝对加密承诺。"
      ],
      [
        "notifications",
        "6. 可选中继、通知与实时活动",
        "通知功能还需系统授权、兼容网页桥/服务端接口与匹配签名环境的 APNs 配置；实时活动可依赖自有兼容中继。",
        "启用兼容路径时，注册所需的设备/通知标识及活动更新会涉及相应服务与 APNs；APNs 私钥应由服务端保管。",
        "默认中继是不可用占位地址，不会自动创建服务。能浏览网页不证明推送已送达，也不把可选通知注册描述为纯本地处理。"
      ]
    ],
    "verificationTitle": "声纹不是身份认证或写入授权",
    "verificationIntro": "声纹匹配是可能误判的便利过滤，不是账号身份认证。当前源码将登记特征保存在本地，并设置文件保护与备份排除；这不是对设备备份或防攻击能力的验收证明。兼容 WeSpeaker/CAM++ 模型未随仓库提供，缺失时依赖它们的验证路径不可用，不应关闭验证来绕过缺失模型。",
    "identityColumns": [
      "层面",
      "由什么决定",
      "不代表什么"
    ],
    "identities": [
      [
        "speaker",
        "声纹便利过滤",
        "本地登记特征与兼容模型提供匹配判断。",
        "不证明账号归属、当前操作意愿、活体检测、防重放或写入权限；不能把“匹配”当成身份认证。"
      ],
      [
        "account",
        "工作台身份认证",
        "你自己的工作台处理登录、配对和会话权限，具体机制以该服务为准。",
        "一呼能打开页面或填入草稿不表示已获得其他账号、设备或资源的权限。"
      ],
      [
        "authorization",
        "写入与确认",
        "服务端决定目标与操作是否允许；PM Radar 决策/验收回复还需独立写入授权、手机明确确认与回执核验。",
        "声纹通过不授权写入；读台账不自动改状态，不自动执行任务、合并或部署。"
      ]
    ],
    "checksTitle": "使用前，按目的地核对",
    "checks": [
      "先核对工作台来源和草稿目标；短语音可能自动尝试填入，录音前就应确认目的地。宿主明确拒绝后不降级绕过，结果不确定先查目标，不盲目再次填入。",
      "复制到本地笔记或其他 App 后，是新的数据副本与处理边界；核对其同步/备份规则。不要在截图、日志或公开反馈中放服务地址、账号/设备标识、录音、私有任务正文或签名材料。",
      "本说明没有替第三方承诺数据保留期、司法地区、删除保证或合规认证；请检查你实际版本、服务配置、系统备份及目标服务政策。录音、推送和 Watch 余项仍沿原设备/服务验收，不由这张表补成已通过。"
    ],
    "linksTitle": "查看当前实现与接入前提",
    "sourceLink": "源码与能力限制",
    "securityLink": "安全说明",
    "startLink": "接入预检与首次草稿"
  },
  "en": {
    "title": "Where data goes at each stage",
    "lead": "On-device speech describes where recognition happens, not an app that never uses the network. This explanation separates the website demo, phone-local processing, web workbenches and optional notification services using current public source and README evidence. It is not a complete device, backup or third-party privacy audit.",
    "nav": "Privacy page navigation",
    "websiteTitle": "Separate the website demo from the iPhone app",
    "website": [
      "The website demo plays a synthetic sample served with the site. It does not request microphone access, connect to your workbench or send a message. Edited text and its demo draft live only in the current page's React state and are not retained after reload.",
      "The production website loads Google Analytics 4 (GA4) by default using regional Consent Mode v2. analytics_storage defaults to denied in the 30 EEA countries (AT, BE, BG, CY, CZ, DE, DK, EE, ES, FI, FR, GR, HR, HU, IE, IS, IT, LI, LT, LU, LV, MT, NL, NO, PL, PT, RO, SE, SI, SK), plus the UK (GB), Switzerland (CH), Brazil (BR) and Japan (JP); it defaults to granted elsewhere. Google applies these regional rules, not browser-language detection. ad_storage, ad_user_data and ad_personalization always remain denied. Regional denial is not zero network: the tag can send cookieless pings and visit/device-related information. This browser persists explicit allow or decline choices and restores them before page configuration events, overriding regional defaults. Change or withdraw your choice using Analytics preferences in the footer. Explicit decline/withdrawal disables future GA collection in this browser, updates consent and clears accessible GA cookies, but the tag file can still be requested; in-flight requests and data already received by Google cannot be recalled. If saving is unavailable, this page still honors refusal and shows a save-failure warning; later pages may restore a previous saved preference and require a new choice. Initial page measurement uses a fixed canonical URL without query, fragment or referrer. Previews do not load the tag. Google signals and ad personalization are disabled, and demo draft text is not sent as events. Hosting providers may still process request logs. This is not legal certification, proof of Google receipt or real-region traffic acceptance."
    ],
    "flowTitle": "Data flow, stage by stage",
    "hint": "Swipe to read the full table. Keyboard users can focus the table and use the arrow keys.",
    "columns": [
      "Stage / data",
      "On the phone",
      "When external services are involved",
      "What this does not promise"
    ],
    "rows": [
      [
        "download",
        "1. Model downloads",
        "Qwen3 ASR models are downloaded separately to the phone. Current model-store code checks pinned revisions, file sizes and SHA-256 hashes.",
        "Downloads make network requests to Hugging Face or ModelScope, requiring bandwidth and storage; the provider can process the corresponding requests.",
        "Downloading models is not uploading recordings. Local inference does not make installation or every feature network-free. Do not skip verification."
      ],
      [
        "transcription",
        "2. On-device transcription",
        "Compatible models process speech on the phone. Short-speech completion may automatically attempt guarded draft insertion; refused or uncertain delivery can retain text.",
        "Once text is handed to a web workbench, it crosses the service boundary in the next relevant row; the whole handoff is not an offline operation.",
        "On-device recognition does not prove the entire app makes no network requests. No accuracy, arbitrary recording-duration or all-device performance guarantee is made here."
      ],
      [
        "notes",
        "3. Local voice notes",
        "Voice notes retain audio and transcripts in app-local storage. Current code attempts to mark the notes directory as excluded from system backups.",
        "Later copying, sharing or workbench handoffs create new destinations; local retention of the original note does not guarantee how those copies are handled.",
        "Setting backup-exclusion flags in source is not verification of a particular device's backups or erasure. It does not promise every copy stays on that phone or has been permanently deleted."
      ],
      [
        "workbench",
        "4. Web workbench and draft handoff",
        "WebKit opens your own HTTPS origin. Its current website data store is persistent and can retain that origin's website data. Speech text can be handed to a compatible draft editor.",
        "Page loads, login, draft handling and user sends/uploads involve the corresponding service; its scripts may save or sync drafts they receive.",
        "Yihu not pressing Send does not mean the page cannot process data beforehand. HTTPS access also does not certify native enhancements or uniform privacy practices."
      ],
      [
        "sharing",
        "5. System share inbox",
        "Text, links and files are staged in an App Group inbox shared by the app and share extension. Staging itself does not automatically send them.",
        "After a user-selected handoff, text can enter a web draft and files can be handed to the page's attachment/upload control. Upload timing and subsequent handling depend on the workbench.",
        "Staging, handoff, attachment upload and message submission are distinct. An unsent message does not prove no file was uploaded. App Group is not a cloud service or a blanket encryption guarantee."
      ],
      [
        "notifications",
        "6. Optional relay, notifications and Live Activities",
        "Notifications also need system permission, a compatible web bridge/server and APNs configuration matching the signing environment. Live Activities may depend on a compatible relay you control.",
        "Enabled compatible paths involve the service and APNs for registration-related device/notification identifiers and activity updates. APNs private keys belong on the server.",
        "The default relay is an unusable placeholder, not an automatically provisioned service. Browsing does not prove push delivery, and optional notification registration is not purely local processing."
      ]
    ],
    "verificationTitle": "Speaker verification is not authentication or write authorization",
    "verificationIntro": "Speaker matching is a convenience filter that can misidentify people, not account authentication. Current source stores enrolled features locally and sets file protection and backup exclusion; that is not device-backup or attack-resistance acceptance evidence. Compatible WeSpeaker/CAM++ artifacts are not included in the repository. Verification-dependent paths are unavailable without them; do not disable verification to bypass missing models.",
    "identityColumns": [
      "Layer",
      "What determines it",
      "What it does not establish"
    ],
    "identities": [
      [
        "speaker",
        "Speaker convenience filter",
        "Local enrolled features and compatible models provide a matching decision.",
        "It does not establish account ownership, current intent, liveness, replay resistance or write permission. A match is not authentication."
      ],
      [
        "account",
        "Workbench authentication",
        "Your own workbench handles login, pairing and session permissions under its particular implementation.",
        "Opening a page or inserting a draft does not grant access to other accounts, devices or resources."
      ],
      [
        "authorization",
        "Writes and confirmation",
        "The server authorizes the target and operation. PM Radar decision/acceptance replies also need separate write authorization, explicit phone confirmation and receipt readback.",
        "A voice match does not authorize a write. Reading the ledger does not automatically change status, execute tasks, merge or deploy."
      ]
    ],
    "checksTitle": "Check each destination before use",
    "checks": [
      "Confirm the workbench origin and draft target before recording because short speech may automatically attempt insertion. Explicit host refusal never falls through to a bypass. Inspect the target after uncertainty instead of blindly inserting again.",
      "Copying into a local note or another app creates another copy and handling boundary; check its sync/backup settings. Do not put service origins, account/device identifiers, recordings, private task text or signing materials in public screenshots, logs or feedback.",
      "This explanation does not promise third-party retention periods, processing jurisdictions, guaranteed deletion or compliance certification. Check your actual app version, service configuration, system backups and destination policy. Remaining recording, push and Watch acceptance is not established by this table."
    ],
    "linksTitle": "Inspect the current implementation and setup prerequisites",
    "sourceLink": "Source and limitations",
    "securityLink": "Security guidance",
    "startLink": "Connection checks and first draft"
  }
};
const privacy = privacyCopy[lang];
const cellStyle = 'padding:20px 16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); vertical-align:top; overflow-wrap:anywhere; text-align:start; font-weight:400;';
const failureTarget = (id: string) => id === 'origin' ? 'address' : ['editor', 'synthetic'].includes(id) ? 'draft' : id;
---
<article class={type === 'start' ? 'document guide-start' : 'document guide-privacy'}>
{type === 'start' ? <>
  <style is:inline>
    .guide-start { max-width: 1120px; }
    .guide-start > h1 { max-width: 20ch; font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); }
    .guide-start > p, .guide-start > ul, .guide-start > ol, .guide-start > section { max-width: 75ch; }
    .guide-start .guide-nav { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 8px 28px; padding-block: 20px; border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .guide-start .guide-nav a { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; }
    .guide-start .guide-scroll-hint { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .guide-start .guide-table { scrollbar-color: var(--muted) var(--surface); scrollbar-width: thin; }
    .guide-start caption { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; }
    .guide-start th:first-child { width: 40%; }
    .guide-start thead th { color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
    .guide-start td { color: var(--muted); }
    .guide-start h3 { font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 32px 0 12px; }
    .guide-start figcaption { color: var(--muted); max-width: 75ch; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    @media (max-width: 600px) { .guide-start .guide-nav { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; } }
  </style>
  <h1>{copy.title}</h1>
  <p class="lead">{copy.lead}</p>
  <nav class="guide-nav" aria-label={copy.nav}>
    <a href="#preflight">{copy.preflightTitle}</a><a href="#build-connect">{copy.buildTitle}</a><a href="#first-draft">{copy.flowTitle}</a><a href="#troubleshooting">{copy.failureTitle}</a>
  </nav>

  <h2 id="preflight">{copy.preflightTitle}</h2>
  <p class="guide-scroll-hint" id="preflight-scroll-hint">{en ? 'Swipe the table to read all columns. Keyboard: focus it and use the arrow keys.' : '左右滑动表格可查看全部列；键盘用户可聚焦表格后使用方向键。'}</p>
  <div class="guide-table" role="region" aria-label={copy.preflightTitle} aria-describedby="preflight-scroll-hint" tabindex="0" style="overflow-x:auto">
    <table style="width:100%; min-width:900px; table-layout:fixed; border-collapse:collapse; text-align:start">
      <caption>{copy.preflightTitle}</caption>
      <thead><tr>{copy.columns.map(label => <th scope="col" style={cellStyle}>{label}</th>)}</tr></thead>
      <tbody>{copy.preflight.map(([id, action, success, failure]) => <tr id={`check-${id}`}>
        <th scope="row" style={cellStyle}>{action}</th>
        <td style={cellStyle}>{success}</td>
        <td style={cellStyle}><a href={`#troubleshoot-${failureTarget(id)}`}>{failure}</a></td>
      </tr>)}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="origin-format">{copy.formatTitle}</h2>
  <p>{copy.formatText}</p>
  <p><code>{copy.originExample}</code></p>
  <p><code>{copy.badExample}</code></p>

  <h2 id="build-connect">{copy.buildTitle}</h2>
  <ol>{copy.buildSteps.map(step => <li>{step}</li>)}</ol>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/alexlee2046/yihu-ios#build-locally">{copy.buildLink}</a></p>

  <h2 id="first-draft">{copy.flowTitle}</h2>
  <p><strong>{copy.syntheticLabel}:</strong> <q>{copy.synthetic}</q></p>
  <figure style="margin:24px 0">
    <figcaption>{copy.flowCaption}</figcaption>
    <pre style="white-space:pre-wrap; overflow-wrap:anywhere; font:inherit; line-height:1.8; padding:16px; background:var(--surface); border-radius:8px">{copy.flow}</pre>
  </figure>
  <p class="guide-scroll-hint" id="draft-scroll-hint">{en ? 'Swipe the table to read all columns. Keyboard: focus it and use the arrow keys.' : '左右滑动表格可查看全部列；键盘用户可聚焦表格后使用方向键。'}</p>
  <div class="guide-table" role="region" aria-label={copy.flowTitle} aria-describedby="draft-scroll-hint" tabindex="0" style="overflow-x:auto">
    <table style="width:100%; min-width:900px; table-layout:fixed; border-collapse:collapse; text-align:start">
      <caption>{copy.flowTitle}</caption>
      <thead><tr>{copy.stepColumns.map(label => <th scope="col" style={cellStyle}>{label}</th>)}</tr></thead>
      <tbody>{copy.steps.map(([title, action, success, failure], index) => <tr id={`draft-step-${index + 1}`}>
        <th scope="row" style={cellStyle}><strong>{title}</strong><br />{action}</th>
        <td style={cellStyle}>{success}</td>
        <td style={cellStyle}>{failure}</td>
      </tr>)}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2 id="troubleshooting">{copy.failureTitle}</h2>
  {copy.failures.map(([id, title, instruction]) => <section aria-labelledby={`troubleshoot-${id}`}>
    <h3 id={`troubleshoot-${id}`}>{title}</h3>
    <p>{instruction}</p>
  </section>)}

  <h2 id="capability-boundaries">{copy.limitsTitle}</h2>
  <ul>{copy.limits.map(limit => <li>{limit}</li>)}</ul>
  <p><a href={en ? '/en/privacy/' : '/privacy/'}>{copy.privacyLink}</a> · <a href={en ? '/en/#capability-speech' : '/#capability-speech'}>{copy.homeLink}</a></p>
  <p><a href={voiceGuidePath}>{en ? 'Compare Dictation, Notes and native workbench drafts' : '对照系统听写、备忘录与原生工作台草稿边界'}</a></p>
  <p><a href={decisionsGuidePath}>{en ? 'Read mobile decisions, source freshness and phone confirmation boundaries' : '查看手机待决策、来源时效与确认回执边界'}</a></p>
  <a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/alexlee2046/yihu-ios#build-locally">{en ? 'Build from source' : '从源码构建'}<img src="/icons/arrow-up-right.svg" width="20" height="20" alt="" /></a>
</> : <>
  <style is:inline>
    .guide-privacy { max-width: 1120px; }
    .guide-privacy > h1 { max-width: 22ch; font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px); }
    .guide-privacy > p, .guide-privacy > ul { max-width: 78ch; }
    .guide-privacy nav { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 24px; padding-block: 16px; }
    .guide-privacy nav a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; }
    .guide-privacy .privacy-table { overflow-x: auto; }
    .guide-privacy table { width: 100%; min-width: 960px; table-layout: fixed; border-collapse: collapse; text-align: start; }
    .guide-privacy caption { text-align: start; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .guide-privacy th, .guide-privacy td { padding: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; text-align: start; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .guide-privacy th:first-child { width: 22%; }
    .guide-privacy th { font-weight: 600; }
    .guide-privacy td { color: var(--muted); }
    .guide-privacy .privacy-hint { font-size: 13px; }
  </style>
  <h1>{privacy.title}</h1>
  <p class="lead">{privacy.lead}</p>
  <nav aria-label={privacy.nav}>
    <a href="#website-demo">{privacy.websiteTitle}</a><a href="#data-flow">{privacy.flowTitle}</a><a href="#verification">{privacy.verificationTitle}</a>
  </nav>
  <h2 id="website-demo">{privacy.websiteTitle}</h2>
  {privacy.website.map(text => <p>{text}</p>)}
  <h2 id="data-flow">{privacy.flowTitle}</h2>
  <p class="privacy-hint" id="data-flow-hint">{privacy.hint}</p>
  <div class="privacy-table" role="region" aria-label={privacy.flowTitle} aria-describedby="data-flow-hint" tabindex="0">
    <table>
      <caption>{privacy.flowTitle}</caption>
      <thead><tr>{privacy.columns.map(label => <th scope="col">{label}</th>)}</tr></thead>
      <tbody>{privacy.rows.map(([id, stage, local, external, limitation]) => <tr id={`flow-${id}`}>
        <th scope="row">{stage}</th><td>{local}</td><td>{external}</td><td>{limitation}</td>
      </tr>)}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <h2 id="verification">{privacy.verificationTitle}</h2>
  <p>{privacy.verificationIntro}</p>
  <p class="privacy-hint" id="verification-hint">{privacy.hint}</p>
  <div class="privacy-table" role="region" aria-label={privacy.verificationTitle} aria-describedby="verification-hint" tabindex="0">
    <table>
      <caption>{privacy.verificationTitle}</caption>
      <thead><tr>{privacy.identityColumns.map(label => <th scope="col">{label}</th>)}</tr></thead>
      <tbody>{privacy.identities.map(([id, layer, control, limitation]) => <tr id={`identity-${id}`}>
        <th scope="row">{layer}</th><td>{control}</td><td>{limitation}</td>
      </tr>)}</tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <h2 id="before-use">{privacy.checksTitle}</h2>
  <ul>{privacy.checks.map(text => <li>{text}</li>)}</ul>
  <h2 id="sources">{privacy.linksTitle}</h2>
  <p><a href="https://github.com/alexlee2046/yihu-ios">{privacy.sourceLink}</a> · <a href="https://github.com/alexlee2046/yihu-ios/blob/main/SECURITY.md">{privacy.securityLink}</a> · <a href={en ? '/en/start/' : '/start/'}>{privacy.startLink}</a></p>
  <p><a href={voiceGuidePath}>{en ? 'Compare Dictation, Notes and native workbench drafts' : '对照系统听写、备忘录与原生工作台草稿边界'}</a></p>
  <p><a href={decisionsGuidePath}>{en ? 'Read mobile decisions, source freshness and phone confirmation boundaries' : '查看手机待决策、来源时效与确认回执边界'}</a></p>
</>}
</article>
